Error analysis

Easy activities for the model: Sitting, Lying, Running, Jumping. These have very clear signals, either flat or with strong peaks.

Hard activities: Ascending stairs vs Descending stairs. The signal looks almost the same in both directions. The model confuses them about 10-15% of the time. Also Standing in elevator vs Moving in elevator is hard because the difference is very small.

