Problems

LSTM had exploding gradients in early epochs. I fixed this by adding clip_grad_norm with max norm 1.0. CNN was overfitting on training data. I fixed this with Dropout layers and weight decay 1e-4. Stairs confusion is still present in both models because the average signal is too similar in both directions.

